{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/278449-fictional-characters-as-lost-fate-stay-night-just-for-fun","id":278449,"title":"Fictional Characters as Lost - Fate/Stay Night - Just for Fun","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-11T16:49:54-07:00","id":278449,"title":"Fictional Characters as Lost - Fate/Stay Night - Just for Fun","content":"So, as a fan of the Nasuverse/Type Moon setting, I at one point had this thought wondering what if the entire Nasuverse was some Keeper's scenario and all the characters were people brainwashed into believing they were the characters. Perhaps not even always the same people fitting into each role. Assuming some managed to escape through the Hedge, perhaps by accident, and came to the real world thinking they were those fictional characters.<br /> <br /> What I came up with for Rin/Saber/Shirou was something like this:<br /> <br /> Rin Tohsaka - Fairest Dual Kith - Shadowsoul Succubus. Shadowsoul because of her tendency to use intimidation fairly frequently. Succubus because in the Visual Novel game paths there is a sex scene in each major story path that consists of Rin deciding that tantric sex will solve some major life-threatening problem. Two paths its her and Shirou and in one path it is her, Saber and Shirou. Even though those are parallel timelines wherein she was supposed to be a virgin, if it were Durance, they could simply be wiping her mind each time to make her forget they've done these things before.<br /> <br /> Saber/Arturia Pendragon - Fairest Dual Kith - Draconic Gandharva. Draconic because she is supposed to have the heart or spirit of a dragon (though replace the bonus Brawl with bonus Weaponry). Gandharva because Saber's Charisma and aura of command is rather extreme in the games and anime. She'd probably have more contracts in the nature of Stone and Vainglory, stuff related to melee combat and leading people into battle.<br /> <br /> Shirou Emiya - Wizened Dual Kith - Soldier Smith. Soldier because of his affinity for Blades and Smith because his basic magical ability is to either reinforce objects which later became creating objects from thin air, especially swords. I can't think of anyway within the Changeling rules to duplicate Unlimited Blade Works. The closest I could think would be if you took the Elemental Contracts with regard to &quot;blades&quot; and had him summoning a rain of blades. I mean, UBW is essentially a state of altered reality in which every sword he has every seen in his life exists, stuck into the ground, complete and perfect even to the point of duplicating magical abilities and even the latent sapience in some of those swords that have almost a mind of their own.<br /> <br /> <br /> Anybody else got some fictional characters that might be interesting if it turned out their lives were Keeper's game?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T03:39:57-07:00","id":278707,"title":"","content":"Just off-topic note, but Nasuverse already has a Changeling material character.<br /> <br /> Satsuki Kurogiri.<br /> <br /> Born in England, he came in contact with fairies, the fairies<b> tampered with him in various ways</b> and caused him to lose his memories.<br /> <br /> Just unsure how to represent the Unified Language. It's more like Dominate that cannot be resisted no matter what (unless earplugs, but Nasu admitted it was stupid to go with such solution).<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Now on topic:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> there is a sex scene in each major story path that consists of Rin deciding that tantric sex will solve some major life-threatening problem. </div> </div> </div>HF never happened? Since Rin is not given the D in HF, but Sakura engages in sex/bloodsucking (depends which edition you read) a lot with her Senpai.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Even though those are parallel timelines wherein she was supposed to be a virgin, if it were Durance, they could simply be wiping her mind each time to make her forget they've done these things before. </div> </div> </div>Shinji is the Keeper now and his realm renamed to Wakame Paradise?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Saber's Charisma and aura of command is rather extreme in the games and anime. </div> </div> </div>Gets TOLD even by 17 year old Japanese high schooler. Some knights leave her court even before Mordred-tan convinced half of the Kingdom to rebel. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> because she is supposed to have the heart or spirit of a dragon </div> </div> </div>It's more in terms of a Magic Core shoved into her by Merlin through artificially inducing dragon blood in her.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> , COMPLETE and perfect </div> </div> </div>No, every copy projected by Shirou is ranked down due to their imperfections except for Avalon because his body has preserved a complete record of it for a decade.<br /> <br /> Complete and perfect is what describes contents of Gate of Babylon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":2918,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","user":"Kat","date":". 10-12-2014, 07:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T03:42:22-07:00","id":278709,"title":"","content":"Though I was assuming that the entirety of Nasuverse IS a Durance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-12T04:11:59-07:00","id":278734,"title":"","content":"Well, I just post about certain discrepancies with the lore facts. Like that Rin has sex in each major path, implying HF is not major. I know, Sakura is controversial, and probably Mike1984/Cherry Lover's behavior did not help to endear her to larger internet community (I swear to God, I have seen him in many non-Nasuver